WEBVTT

1
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:23,470
This young lady, your knife

2
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:29,300
Miss, do you want to collect the medicine? I'll get you a big knife.

3
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,900
Go and install it for me over there.

4
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,300
This is our stuff. You can take it with you.

5
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,700
Give us a condition

6
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:43,780
You took our stuff

7
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,740
You have to keep us safe, right?
